<TextIndex heading="What is strata cleaning?" fs="Strata cleaning is the scheduled cleaning of a building's shared areas \u2013 a trained team keeps foyers, lifts, carparks and amenities to a documented standard on a recurring roster." items={([{"term": "Strata cleaning melbourne", "text": "runs this way for strata managers", "icon": "sparkles"}, {"term": "Shared areas", "text": "hold no single owner to complain for them", "icon": "map"}])} copy={({"heading": "What is strata cleaning?", "answer": "Strata cleaning is **the scheduled cleaning of a building's shared areas** – a trained team keeps foyers, lifts, carparks and amenities to a documented standard on a recurring roster.", "before": ["The work answers to the strata manager and the strata management company, not to one household: the owners corporation signs for the scope, and the same residents judge the result every day.", "That is why the standard stays written down – shared areas hold no single owner to complain for them.", "Common-area work differs from a residential booking because the payer judges collectively.", "The owners corporation holds the budget, the committee holds the vote, and the manager answers when a foyer slips – so the scope stays written and reported.", "Strata Cleaning Melbourne runs this way for strata managers, owners corporations and building managers. Foyers mark the building's first impression, and the roster keeps it fixed."], "items": [], "list_ordered": false, "qa": [], "links": [], "after": []})} brand="Whistle Clean" logo="/logo.svg" />
